ill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Good news Miranda! Holly's has accepted the partnership with Polygon.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Fantastic! We've been anticipating this. You weren't taken by surprise, were you?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: No, I could sense Farmani was leaning our way.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I felt that as soon as he gave us the extension. That was a strong indication, if you ask me.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I think you really persuaded him.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We all did! Congratulations!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Everyone's worked hard. On that note, how do you want to celebrate this? Perhaps with a luncheon?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I must say I like the idea. Should I look into a caterer?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Yes. To be honest, you're good at that. By the way, what kind of diets do people follow?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We have a few vegans and vegetarians. I could be wrong, but we have some employees on a high protein diet, so we need meat as well.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: How about you?", "id": 2, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm on a gluten-free, low-fat, and low-sodium diet.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Sounds complicated. But, we haven't mentioned dessert. How do you feel about including some chocolate?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Of course! I see chocolate on your desk everyday.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I know. I'm addicted to it. Oh that reminds me, we should get a cake!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Speaking of sweets, I'll bring us some coffees before we spend some time discussing where to go from here. How do you take yours?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I take two creams and no sugar. Thanks Miranda.", "id": 3, "time": "61000", "image": "engenn7le09ob01re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le09ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le09ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}